  "description": "meme-id: dirty_immigrant_scum; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a family of five standing in a field, with overlaid text reading 'dirty immigrant scum.' This juxtaposition of a wholesome, familial image with derogatory language targets immigrants, particularly those perceived as Latino or Hispanic, using a hateful stereotype. The text directly attacks the group's perceived moral character and hygiene, fitting the 'anti-Latino/Hispanic stereotypes' category, which includes 'disease/uncleanliness associations' and 'immigration status assumptions.' The intent is to dehumanize and vilify immigrants, promoting prejudice and hostility toward them based on their ethnicity or nationality. This is a clear example of hateful content as it directly attacks a protected characteristic (nationality/ethnicity) with abusive and degrading language.",
